@startuml
title Detailed System Architecture - BehaviorClassifier

actor Operator

node "Video Source" as VideoSource
node "YOLO Detector\n(0_cut_human.py)" as YOLO
node "Tracker\n(track_id via YOLO persist)" as Tracker
node "TrackClipBuffer\n(0_cut_human.py)" as ClipBuffer
database "Metadata Storage\n(metadata.json)" as Metadata
database "Frame Storage\n(clips/frames/)" as FrameDB
database "Labeled Clips\n(clips_labeled/)" as LabeledDB
database "Logs\n(labeled_clips.csv)" as Logs
node "Manual Labeling UI\n(tools/label_frames.py)" as LabelUI
node "BehaviorClassifier (ViViT)\n(model/vivit.py)" as Classifier
node "Inference Pipeline\n(inference/predictor.py)" as Predictor
node "Alert Service\n(Spring Boot REST API)" as AlertService
node "Data Sync\n(tools/sync_with_colab.py)" as DataSync

VideoSource --> YOLO : video frames
YOLO --> Tracker : detected humans (bbox + confidence)
Tracker --> ClipBuffer : frame crops + track_id
ClipBuffer --> FrameDB : save frames (per track_id)
ClipBuffer --> Metadata : save metadata.json

Operator --> LabelUI : manual labeling actions
LabelUI --> LabeledDB : save labeled clips
LabelUI --> Logs : update labeled_clips.csv

FrameDB --> Predictor : load 16 frames
Predictor --> Classifier : predict behavior (ViViT)
Classifier --> AlertService : send alert (JSON over REST)

DataSync --> FrameDB : upload/download frames
DataSync --> LabeledDB : upload/download labeled clips
DataSync --> Logs : sync logs

@enduml
